3020 DATA SIX TEEN,SEVEN TEEN,EIGHT TEEN,NINE TEEN
3030 DATA TWENTY,THIRTY,FORTY,FIFTY,SIXTY,SEVENTY,EIGHTY,NINETY
3040 DATA BLACK,2,GREEN,3,BLUE,5,CYAN,8,RED,9,YELLOW,11,MAGENTA,14,GRAY,15,WHITE,16
